tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
